{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s8c537d6cbda6f304","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-55a16a6baac80eac8a73","text":"怎么样？找到要拍的东西了吗？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-442370a6c08fa9686783","text":"（展示照片）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-67379cb71295f9db9efe","text":"哎呀，照片里的虎克还是很可爱的嘛","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5eab60cfb8e3858eb839","text":"我还记得这个俱乐部，咱还在这里打了场比赛呢！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-d40de194f41817ca1011","text":"我的技术进步了吧？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8370d97dff221a822f31","text":"我的拍照技术是不是进步了很多？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-aa01871987ab4daaafd1","text":"别太得意了，想要拍出好照片，你还有很多东西要学呢！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c163eaed6ef93a2af425","text":"但我也不会教你的，这样你就没法超过我咯","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f3ce362453d533d9f405","text":"都是很有趣的照片","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ea71d1f338be95762fa3","text":"这些照片的内容都很有趣","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-da822c9cfc7143c024c7","text":"当然了，那可都是我认真收集的！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f030aa8074da5754a1a4","text":"照片就快要收集完了，继续加油哦！","speaker":"三月七"}]}
